# Full-corpus release bundles are large reproducible artifacts: the 3,088-document
# release is 124MB across 12,353 files. Per WAVE-117 they belong in the cell
# object store with a committed checksummed lock, not in Git.
#
# What IS committed: every *.lock.json, the small starter bundle, the cumulative
# released-state ledger, and the validation proofs under proofs/.
topeka-source-*-r2/
topeka-source-*-refresh/
